## applications.ttl — A-Box: 30 credit applications + emitted signals
##
## Each application emits at least one CreditScoreSignal; many also emit
## an EmploymentStabilitySignal (needed by SWRL R4 in §6).
##
## Signal value convention (normalized 0-1, higher = lower risk):
##   - CreditScoreSignal value ≈ (FICO - 300) / 550, clipped to [0, 1]
##   - EmploymentStabilitySignal value ≈ min(employmentYears / 10, 1.0)
##   - Other signals are illustrative; precise calibration is left to NB04
##
## Timestamps are all 2026-05 (within 90-day staleness window per SHACL §5.7).

@prefix :     <https://nikko.dev/ontology/credit#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

